97996	scriptorium	translation	Then the holy man Apa Colluthus questioned him, saying, \'The God-loving clergy (of the town of Coptos) state that pig thy holiness saith: \'If it were not that I would not be disobedient unto him that hath sent you unto me, I would not occupy this position (of bishop) at all.\'
